        "synopsis": {
            "value": "The drama tells of an android called Nam Sin III, who must pretend to be the son of a rich family when the real Nam Sin falls into a coma.\n\nNam Sin's mother, O Ro Ra, is a genius at brain technology and artificial intelligence (AI), so when her son, the real Nam Sin, is taken away from her at a young age, in her grief, she creates an android that looks\n\nexactly like her son and has it grow up in place of Nam Sin.\n\nBut when Nam Sin, who is a third-generation heir to the PK group, gets in an accident and becomes comatose, the android Nam Sin III must learn how to take his place.",
